  "name": "Artichoke, Chickpea and Feta Salad",
  "subtitle": "A bright, briny salad assembled in minutes",
  "description": "Toss crisp vegetables, legumes, artichokes, peppers, herbs, and feta with vinegar and sundried-tomato oil for a fresh no-cook salad.",
